cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Energy Data Onboarding and Demand Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Two reproducible Python packages for onboarding public building-electricity
  meter data (Building Data Genome 2) with quality gates, seeded fault
  injection and past-only remediation, and for measuring how those data
  conditions affect 24-hour-ahead demand forecasts. Successor to the author's
  January 2026 capstone "Machine Learning for Reliable Energy Demand
  Forecasting in U.S. Energy Infrastructure" (IMA 2026 poster).
authors:
